# Senior React Native — Checklist & roadmap (30-day summary + **45-day Udemy map**)

This document complements `prompt.md`: build **Senior Mobile App Engineer (React Native)** solidly enough to interview at **many company types** (product, agency, enterprise, startup—not locked to one vertical like FinTech), combining **project-first** work with **4 mapped Udemy courses** in **Section 7**.

