## 1. Senior Mobile (RN) knowledge frame — any company

Use this as a **reference** when reading JDs or interviewing; the 30-day track **covers** core rows; some (animation, deep design system) can **extend** after 30 days or merge into review weeks.

| Pillar                      | What to be solid on                                                                                                                                | Interview notes                                  |
| --------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| **Architecture & boundaries** | Feature/module folders, dependency direction, avoid coupling                                                                                     | “Scale to 10+ engineers?” “Avoid circular deps?” |
| **Design system & UI**     | Reusable components, theme/tokens, empty/loading/error; **a11y**                                                                                  | “Design system from scratch?” “a11y checklist?”   |
| **React patterns**         | Custom hooks, compound components (when fit); HOC/render props **know when / legacy**                                                            | Trade-off: readability vs maintain               |
| **State & data**           | Server vs client state; Redux Toolkit / TanStack Query; cache, invalidation                                                                       | “When Redux vs Query?”                           |
| **API layer**              | REST/GraphQL basics; errors; typed contracts; interceptors                                                                                        | “Single error handling layer?”                   |
| **Performance**            | FlatList, images, re-renders, measured memo; React Profiler / Flipper                                                                            | Before/after metrics                             |
| **RN platform**            | Complex navigation; native bridge when needed; **New Architecture** & **Hermes** (explain level); Reanimated + Gesture Handler (if JD needs UX) | “Fabric/TurboModules?”                           |
| **Quality**                | Jest + RTL; E2E smoke (Detox/Maestro); CI lint/test                                                                                              | “Testing pyramid?”                               |
| **Reliability**            | Sentry/Crashlytics, release health, controlled logging                                                                                            | “On-call mindset?”                               |
| **Security & privacy**     | Tokens, secure storage, PII logging, TLS basics, OWASP Mobile                                                                                     | Any app with user data                           |
| **Communication & leadership** | ADRs, code review, STAR stories, **English**                                                                                                  | Behavioral + system design (mobile scope)        |

